{"reviews":[{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-0","r":1.0,"t":"Rips my hair out","x":"I bought this hair dryer for the diffuser because I have long curly hair.  The back of the blow dryer sucks air in like a vacuum so while I'm blowing my hair dry though the diffuser, my long hair is getting sucked through the back hole and ripped and burned off. If you have long hair this blow dryer is a piece of crap!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-1","r":4.0,"t":"Decent for my super long hair","x":"My 15 year old conair hair dryer finally died (and almost flamethrowered my face) so I needed a new one. I hardly ever dry my hair. Mostly during winter or for an event. When I do dry it, I use the cool air setting, never hot. I needed a dryer that had powerful air flow, actual cool air, and that wouldn\u2019t kill me. Safety plug feature was also necessary. Apparently the expensive ones aren\u2019t too different from affordable ones so I decided to try this one. The weight is fine to me although I wouldn","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-2","r":1.0,"t":"FALSE ADVERTISEMENT!  BEWARE!","x":"This dryer DOES NOT come with the advertised attachments! - The ones we are paying for!!  They wouldn\u2019t even fit in the box the dryer comes in, so I\u2019m relatively sure this is the norm for this dryer.  FALSE ADVERTISEMENT!!!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-3","r":5.0,"t":"Superb","x":"I\u2019ve been meaning to buy a dryer since mine is super old and falling apart. I am so glad I bought this dryer!! Very durable. Not cheaply made at all.  Love that it comes with several attachments.  This is the perfect dryer.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-4","r":5.0,"t":"Amaze-balls!!!","x":"Ok, I looooove love love this! It comes with 4 tips!! My hair feels so much better and makes my morning routine so much easier. Definitely recommend!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-5","r":5.0,"t":"GREAT PRODUCT!","x":"[[VIDEOID:d23fce1463173980a55f780e60e60ac3]] I love this blow dryer. It drys your hair super fast and gives it a shine, its small not so big and it comes with Finger Diffuser, Styling pik, & a Styling Nozzle great for the price, one thing I would say if you trying to get less noise this isn't it ... its pretty loud .. but overall this drys my hair fast and easy.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-6","r":4.0,"t":"Great Blow Dryer","x":"I absolutely love this blower dryer; especially both the diffuser and straightener attachments.  I love the warm/cool feature as well.  I didn't give it a five-star because I find it hard to switch between attachments. It gives me a lot of trouble.  However; other than that, this is a great blow dryer and I would recommend it for anyone with any hair type.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-7","r":5.0,"t":"Best dryer EVER","x":"Best handheld hair dryer....and love the attachments...it really gets the job done..it goes great with a drying bonnet...im loving it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-8","r":1.0,"t":"Missing styling pic and diffuser","x":"Returned 2 times because it did not include styling pic and diffuser.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-9","r":5.0,"t":"Pleasantly surprised with this Hair Dryer","x":"This hair dryer replaced a hair dryer I loved but couldn't find the brand again... So expectations were hopeful but skeptical when it arrived.  It turns out that I was really pleasantly surprised to find out I like it better than the hair dryer that had quit on me just a few weeks before. It's much easier to handle, it's smaller and the nozzle is shorter, but dried my hair just as quickly and thoroughly.  Love it!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-10","r":1.0,"t":"Missing attachments","x":"I read the other reviews that said they didn't get the attachments and thought it was a fluke.  Just got mine delivered today and guess what- I didn't get them either.  Apparently it is not just a fluke\ud83d\ude06.  I ordered the black one and got the black and red one (maybe the attachments don't come with the red and black one?)  Really wanted the diffuser.  That is why I purchased this item.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-11","r":5.0,"t":"Works well.","x":"I haven't used a hair dryer for years because of damage to my hair. This year the winter is killing my hair because I go outside shortly after showering. I like this dryer because it has several attachments to do various things and so far so good. No damage.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-12","r":3.0,"t":"Small & heavy.","x":"Really small like what you\u2019d use at a hotel, but really heavy. I\u2019m returning for that reason alone. I really liked that it had lots of attachments & different settings. Can\u2019t speak to how well it works.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-13","r":5.0,"t":"Sent as a gift","x":"I sent this as a gift for my girlfriend who's hair dryer she had for 20 years finally died.  She loves it and says it works great. She has curly hair and tells me that the diffuser is perfect for her needs, and considering how great her hair looks I'd have to agree. The price was great and shipping was fast!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-14","r":4.0,"t":"A little heavy and the buttons are right where your hand goes.","x":"Not a totally convenient dryer.  Not too heavy, but not lightweight or small.  And the on/off and temperature buttons are right where you put your hand, so they sometimes get switched if I try to maneuver the dryer.  Not bad, though, and decent price.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-15","r":4.0,"t":"Great Value","x":"Great ionic hairdryer. It came with a lot of little gadgets that I now need to learn to use. But the dryer itself works well. Blows very well bought for my  mom who is very picky, she likes it. Hopefully it lasts for a long time \ud83e\udd17","h":2,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-16","r":5.0,"t":"Natural Hair","x":"Love it! If you have thick natural hair like me, the comb teeth will keep breaking until it's none left. I\ufe0f recommend the teeth comb that's recommended for natural hair. The one that doesn't break.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-17","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed!","x":"Dryer did not come with all attachments just came with the concentrator ! Nice dryer but I mainly needed the comb that was supposed to come with it and spent $40 and didn\u2019t even get that !","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-18","r":5.0,"t":"Good investment","x":"I really like this hair dryer.  It takes less time to dry hair and very lightweight.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-19","r":5.0,"t":"Does it\u2019s job well","x":"Works very well, as described. Dry my hair quickly. I would recommend this item.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-20","r":4.0,"t":"Compact, not bulky","x":"I haven't used the blow dryer yet. I'll update this review after I have.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-21","r":5.0,"t":"A blow dryer worth trying!","x":"The dryer works great and dries hair fast. Definitely a good value.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-22","r":5.0,"t":"It works just the way i needed it to ! Thanks a million","x":"Packaged well. All the pieces we're included as in picture.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-23","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"Love this blow dryer, so much power dries my hair quickly!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B0815Y3L6V-24","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Dryer doesn\u2019t get hot enough. Waste of money! Don\u2019t buy!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the dryer's included attachments and consider it a great value.","cites":[4,5,6,8,12]},{"text":"Several reviewers report that the advertised attachments were missing from their order.","cites":[3,9,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the dryer heavy and/or small, and note awkward button placement.","cites":[13,15]},{"text":"Reviewers with curly or long hair report the diffuser works well for their needs.","cites":[2,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention difficulty switching between attachments or excessive noise.","cites":[6,7]}]},"qa":[]}